<title>PHILIPPINES: First Holdings nine-mth net 1.28 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>First Holdings nine-mth net 1.28 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Philippine Holdings Corp, a unit of Benpres Holdings Corp, said on Wednesday its net income for the first nine months of the year to March 31 was 1.28 billion pesos.</p>
<p>In its unaudited results, the company said net income for the third quarter alone was 313.52 million pesos.</p>
<p>It did not give any comparsions.</p>
</text>
